"user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-12-12T19:12:11Z","updated_at":"2014-12-12T19:12:11Z","body":"Just a note regarding GoPro's live preview stream. Only Hero2/3/3+ support HLS at the given endpoint (http://10.5.5.9:8080/live/amba.m3u8).\n\nJust summarize the streaming formats for various GoPro models:\n- Hero2: HLS\n- Hero3: HLS\n- Hero3+: HLS and UDP\n- Hero4: UDP only\n\nMy point is that I would not invest a lot of time trying to get good user experience from GoPro's HLS stream.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/66819722/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ptran-gpfw","id":3084650,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODQ2NTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3084650?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw","html_url":"https://github.com/ptran-gpfw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ptran-gpfw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":210128772,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDIxMDEyODc3Mg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/210128772","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"1fce55f6fe15991106202c8054b51fa2c0b53195","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/commits/1fce55f6fe15991106202c8054b51fa2c0b53195","created_at":"2014-12-19T12:14:47Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/67631780","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/116#issuecomment-67631780","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/116","id":67631780,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY3NjMxNzgw","user":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-12-19T12:20:31Z","updated_at":"2014-12-19T12:20:31Z","body":"I wasn't able to reproduce the same problem as mentioned at the top of this page, but with the latest dev-hls I'm able to (more or less) successfully stream HLS from a GoPro Hero3. The one caveat is that the player will get stuck in a buffering state after some period of time. This is due to a known issue where the GoPro incorrectly claims each segment is 1 second in duration, when actually it's usually less. We don't plan to implement a workaround in ExoPlayer, particularly since new GoPro devices don't support HLS anyway. If you want to fix it locally in your own application, all you need to do is edit this piece of code:\n\nhttps://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/blob/dev-hls/library/src/main/java/com/google/android/exoplayer/hls/HlsChunkSource.java#L221\n\nto have the condition instead be just:\n\nif (previousTsChunk != null && previousTsChunk.isLastChunk) {\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/67631780/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/ow